WEBVTT - Sintel (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Cold wind howling across the icy peaks]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A lonely traveler trudges through the bitter snowstorm.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Sintel clutches her staff, searching for Scales.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
An old hermit watches from a mountain cavern.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Hermit: "What brings a girl so far up these treacherous lands?"

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Sintel: "I'm looking for someone... a friend."

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
[Flashback: In the bustling alleys of Wisp]

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
A young baby dragon lay wounded by the city gates.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Sintel nursed the small creature back to health.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:27.000
"I named him Scales... he became my family."
